WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.025
A Sound object, and Play

2
00:00:02.826 --> 00:00:05.576
Add a Sound object, and rename it Cheer.

3
00:00:11.596 --> 00:00:14.471
Put it under the bar, and choose the Win jingle.

4
00:00:18.732 --> 00:00:22.882
A new event. Variable Glasses equals Goal, then Play Cheer.

5
00:00:35.548 --> 00:00:37.973
Now run it, get to eight, and listen.
